    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539-a1">

                <pb facs="0380" n="308" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg308"/>

                <p rendition="#center">ACROSTIC ON ABRAHAM LINCOLN.</p>
                <lg>
                    <l>A nation—nor one only—mourns thy loss,</l>
                    <l>Brave Lincoln, and with voice unanimous</l>
                    <l>Raise to thy deathless memory</l>
                    <l>A dirge-like song of all thy noble deeds.</l>
                    <l>High let it rise; and I, too, fain would add</l>
                    <l>A loving tribute to thy priceless worth,</l>
                    <l>More widely known since banished from the earth.</l>
                </lg>
                <lg>
                    <l>Laurel shall now thy brow entwine</l>
                    <l>In memory’s ever faithful shrine;</l>
                    <l>Nor shall it fade when earth dissolves.</l>
                    <l>Caught up to meet thee in the air,</l>
                    <l>Old age and youth shall bless thee there;</l>
                    <l>Love shall her grateful tribute pay,</l>
                    <l>Nor cease through heaven’s eternal day.</l>
                </lg>
                <closer>
                    <signed>GRACE W. GRAY.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Northampton, England.</hi>
                    </p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
